{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01KgQZ2iiNxt6FQpq41Xftnz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the workspace's `CLAUDE.md`, here's what this project **is**:\n\n- **It's John Liechty's \"Agentic Sandbox\"** (`C:\\dev\\Agentic-Home`) â€” a *research* workspace for building, training, and evaluating clusters of AI agents, not a production system. Most of its ~80 root files are design docs (whitepapers, plans, session logs); a smaller set is runnable code.\n\n- **The active shipped deliverable is the Ghost World Labs (GWL-M) GUI** â€” a Next.js app in `sandbox-lab-gui/` (launched via `Launch-Ghost-World-Labs.bat`, custom Next.js + WebSocket `server.mjs` on port 3001) that **launches and supervises agents** running on the **OpenClaw** runtime (MIT-licensed, installed globally via npm).\n\n- **It runs a \"t2r\" brain architecture** â€” a Tasteâ†’Reason dispatcher (`brain/dispatcher/t2r-dispatcher.mjs`) behind the daily-use `alpha-v0` agent, with a hand-built **sovereign harness** (`gwl-t2r-brain/harness/`) that owns its own cost-controlled ReAct loop. The stated design goal is *\"distill from frontier models into small local students\"* â€” QLoRA fine-tuning of â‰¤8B models on the box's RTX 4070.\n\n- **It ships an agent registry + routing system** â€” `routing.json` drives per-agent provider/model selection, a Settings Vault edits API keys/models, and `agent-chat.mjs` spawns OpenClaw turns. The default GUI surface shows just the `alpha-v0` daily vehicle; research/legacy agents hide behind a toggle.\n\n- **A deliberate cost/identity boundary:** the user's own Claude Code/Cowork session uses a subscription (no API key); agents launched *inside* the GUI spend metered API budget (`.env` keys). The two must not be confused.\n\n- **Supporting infrastructure it maintains:** a master skill repo (`skills-master/`, linked into Claude/Gemini, copied into OpenClaw), a Foreman-driven multi-wave build pipeline, and a large set of architecture whitepapers + a K-12 curriculum deliverable.\n\nOne note: I see `Anchor.md`, `.anchor/`, and the `anchor-coach` skill present but untracked â€” if your actual intent was to run an Anchor coaching exercise on this summary rather than just get the summary, say so and I'll switch modes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7051,"cache_read_input_tokens":40827,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7051,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b1f2c32-a97f-4eb5-8206-aceb1bbe74e4","uuid":"18d98faa-2bf4-4bc3-8e01-918ced379335","request_id":"req_011Cc38n9iufqDnssy5k2ATG"}
